Breakpoints: sm 640 / md 768 / lg 1024 / xl 1280 / 2xl 1440. See project.md.

The assessment brief tests specific literal viewport widths — always manually verify the layout (no horizontal scroll, no clipped/overlapping content) at 375px and 480px (mobile), 768px and 1024px (tablet), 1440px (desktop), and at least one ultra-wide width (e.g. 1920px+) where content stays centered inside the 1440px container.

