## Project Structure

```
src/app/
  core/           # singleton services, guards, interceptors
  shared/
    ui/           # dumb, reusable presentational components (button, card, badge...)
    utils/        # pipes, directives, helper functions
  features/
    hero/
    about/
    services/
    testimonials/
    contact/
    footer/
    navbar/
  pages/
    home/
    done/         # /done success page
```

Each feature folder is self-contained (component + styles + any feature-specific types). Anything reused across two or more features moves into `shared/ui`. Before creating a new component, check `shared/ui` first.
